  <p>Stable's and US Global Mail's prices depend on monthly vs yearly billing. The figures above are the lowest shown on each pricing page, and the existing <a href="/virtual-mailbox-pricing-comparison/">comparison table</a> has both billing options.</p>

  <h2>Cheapest compliant setups</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>You'll be your own registered agent</strong> at a home or office address in the state: add the cheapest business mailbox for everything else. Traveling Mailbox Basic is $15 <Src href={S.tmb} /> and iPostal1 Virtual Business Address is $14.99 <Src href={S.ipVba} />. Keep in mind your agent address becomes public record <Src href={S.caFaq} label="CA SOS" />.</li>
